  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "りょううでを　まわし　あいてに　あてる。\nあいての　のうりょく　へんかに\nかんけいなく　ダメージを　あたえる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "양팔을 돌려 상대에게 부딪친다.\n상대의 능력 변화에\n상관없이 데미지를 준다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "旋轉雙臂並打向對手。\n可不顧對手的能力變化\n給予傷害。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Le Pokémon étend les bras et frappe l’adversaire\nen tournant violemment. Inflige des dégâts et ignore\nles changements de stats de la cible.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Der Anwender wirbelt mit beiden Armen und prallt\nso auf das Ziel. Richtet unabhängig von den\nStatusveränderungen des Zieles Schaden an.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Gira sobre sí mismo y golpea al oponente con ambos\nbrazos. Ignora los cambios en las características del\nobjetivo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chi la usa attacca il bersaglio mulinando gli arti.\nIl danno inflitto ignora le modifiche alle statistiche\ndel bersaglio.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user swings both arms and hits the target.\nThe target’s stat changes don’t affect this\nattack’s damage.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "両腕を　回し　相手に　当てる。\n相手の　能力変化に\n関係なく　ダメージを　与える。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "旋转双臂打向对手。\n无视对手的能力变化，\n直接给予伤害。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Gira sobre sí mismo y golpea al oponente con ambos\nbrazos. Ignora los cambios en las características del\nobjetivo.",
